OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA few showers to start the day
OL,6,Fin the north, a lot of dry and bright
OL,7,Fweather around with Autumn sunshine,
OL,8,Fstill quite a breezy day with fresh
OL,9,Fwesterly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA few showers for Antrim
OL,12,Fcoast but otherwise dry with clear
OL,13,Fspells and winds beginning to ease
OL,14,Fovernight, feeling quite chilly.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSunday:FA dry and bright day with
OL,17,Fplenty of Autumn sunshine and lighter
OL,18,Fwinds than of late. Clouding over in
OL,19,Fthe afternoon with some evening rain
OL,20,Fin the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
