OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA
OL,6,Fmore settled start to next week and
OL,7,Fstarting to feel warm. Any rain on
OL,8,FMonday turning light and patchy, risk
OL,9,Fof a few showers on Tuesday and
OL,10,FWednesday.
